  "description": "RENGAT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H264 Dy8 O48. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.574-3.796 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.42-111.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy(OC2H4OPri)3]8.",
